<!DOCTYPE html>
  <html lang="en">
    <head>
      <meta charset="utf-8">
      <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
      <title>IndieHackers Feed</title>
      <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/awsm.css/dist/awsm_theme_big-stone.min.css">
    </head>
    <body>
  <h1>IndieHackers Feed</h1>
  <p>This is an unofficial feed of indiehackers.com</p>

  <h2>Posts feed</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a target="_blank" href="/posts.rss">RSS</a></li>
      <li><a target="_blank" href="/posts.atom">Atom</a></li>
      <li><a target="_blank" href="/posts.json">JSON</a></li>
    </ul>

  <h2>Top posts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>week
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/week/posts.rss">RSS</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/week/posts.atom">Atom</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/week/posts.json">JSON</a>
      </li>
      <li>month
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/month/posts.rss">RSS</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/month/posts.atom">Atom</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/month/posts.json">JSON</a>
      </li>
      <li>year
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/year/posts.rss">RSS</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/year/posts.atom">Atom</a>
        <a target="_blank" href="/top/year/posts.json">JSON</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

  <h2>Group post feeds</h2>
    <a href="/groups">A list of group post feeds</a>

  <h2>Search</h2>
  <p>
    You can search by using the 'q' parameter
    <br/>
    Examples:
    <ul>
      <li><code>https://feed.indiehackers.world/posts.rss?<strong>q=</strong>keywords</code></li>
    </ul>
  </p>

  <h2>Exclude link posts</h2>
  <p>
    You can exclude link posts using 'exclude' parameter
    <br/>
    <br/>
    Examples:
    <ul>
      <li><code>https://feed.indiehackers.world/posts.rss?<strong>exclude=</strong>link-post</code></li>
    </ul>
  </p>

  <h2>User post feed</h2>
  <p>
    Get your favorite user's post feed
    <br/>
    Examples:
    <ul>
      <li><code>https://feed.indiehackers.world/user/<strong>:username</strong>/posts.rss</code></li>
      <li><code>https://feed.indiehackers.world/user/<strong>:username</strong>/posts.atom</code></li>
      <li><code>https://feed.indiehackers.world/user/<strong>:username</strong>/posts.json</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>My feeds</h3>
    <a target="_blank" href="/user/pyoner/posts.rss">RSS</a>
    <a target="_blank" href="/user/pyoner/posts.atom">Atom</a>
    <a target="_blank" href="/user/pyoner/posts.json">JSON</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Support the project</h2>
  <p>
    If you like the feed and want to support it then you can buy me a coffee!
  </p>
  <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/pyoner" target="_blank"><img src="https://cdn.buymeacoffee.com/buttons/v2/default-yellow.png" alt="Buy Me A Coffee" style="height: 60px !important;width: 217px !important; display: inline;" ></a>

  <h2>Social Links</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://t.me/pyoner">Telegram</a></li>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/pyoner">Twitter</a></li>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/pyoner">Github</a></li>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/pyoner">BMC</a></li>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://www.indiehackers.com/pyoner">IndieHackers</a></li>
    <li><a target="_blank" href="https://t.me/indiehackersworld">Telegram Channel</a></li>
  </ul>
